Cell["The complete polarisation-contracted, amputated off-shell tree \
expression is stored in \[ScriptCapitalM] (Mathematica's ScriptCapitalM \
symbol). Its preview below is shortened only for display. This is not yet an \
on-shell physical scattering amplitude: the external virtualities, \
longitudinal contractions and trace terms remain unconstrained. No loop \
measure or spin sum is included.", "Text", ExpressionUUID -> 
          "460c06eb-23a9-45da-93f4-23d0e7b522bf"],

